de`, `get_next_page` and the application `increment` tool, plus the recorded dependencies.\n  - `application_tool_factories_create_fresh_state_for_each_agent_call` asserts fresh tool state per call.\n- **Structured submission:** the typed `submit_result` answer is parsed and returned and its fingerprint is stored (`behavioral_adequacy_uses_domain_contents_and_returns_a_typed_fingerprinted_answer`). Concurrent calls keep their submissions apart (`concurrent_tool_agents_isolate_histories_pages_and_submissions_and_share_reads`, `agent_executions_isolate_conversations_and_dependency_traces`).\n\nI found no behavioral obligation in the text that lacks a test with a relevant assertion."
